  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Enjoy our luxurious new 4 Bedroom home located in The Village at Grayton Beach in beautiful Grayton Beach. The Village is an elegant coastal community of just 47 homes nestled among native pine and oak trees. <br><br>Grayton Beach is like no other beach town along 30A. Enjoy the famous white sand and emerald waters without the crowds, soak in Graytons quirky, free spirit, laid back attitude and iconic beaches. Paddle board or kayak on the famous dune lakes or snorkel the Sea Turtle Reef in the Gulf of Mexico. <br><br>While here you can park the car and ride your bicycle. We are located a short 1 mile ride from the sugar sands and emerald waters of Grayton Beach, 1.2 miles to Grayton Beach State Park and 2.3 miles to all there is to offer in Seaside which was the picturesque setting seen in The Truman Show. We are also just a short walk to great dining with nearby restaurants like Hurricane Oyster Bar, Nanbu Noodle Bar, Chanticleer, Pickle Factory, Grayton Corner Café and Black Bear Bread Company. You can go a little further by bicycle to AJ’s, Chiringo, Crackings, Grayton Seafood Company or the must see, World Famous, Red Bar. 30A has so much to offer and Grayton Beach places you right in the middle of the action without the crowds or expense.<br><br>Our home is nicely decorated and perfect for family getaways, with 2 luxurious Master Suites, both, King Beds, a third bedroom features a Queen bed and lastly, a bonus room with 2 sets of bunk beds easily sleeping 4 children. All rooms have flat screen TV’s, ample closet space and the kids room has a DVD player with plenty of movies to keep them occupied. We have 4 beach cruisers available for your use or if would rather ride, rent a golf cart for your stay. You are sure to love the area and all it has to offer.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Grayton Beach Vacation House- park your car, hop on a bike, explore!"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
